The implementation model is now settled: immutable persisted profile values in one validated JSON envelope, plus one long-lived observable runtime object per UUID. Each session will own its process, stderr buffer, readiness token, stop escalation, and generation guard; the SwiftUI rows will only read those stable objects and invoke controller operations. This follows the SwiftUI skill’s state/identity guidance and keeps all persistence/process logic outside views.
